# Pairs with SagaBatchOnOneCopy. Reproduces production before #4454 was fixed (#4521): when
# the routing tier refuses part of a dispatch because the tree moved,
# TryRebindToResolvedCopyAsync re-binds even though the bound copy mirrors into
# the new one, leaving the prepares already taken on T behind.
MODULE: SagaBatchOnOneCopyRebindIgnoresMirror
TARGET: SagaBatchOnOneCopy
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a mid-dispatch re-bind ignores the mirror check and strands partial prepares on the old copy
PERTURBS: SagaRebindOnRefusal

--- FIND
SagaRebindOnRefusal ==
    /\ sg = "exec"
    /\ ~BoundMirrors
--- REPLACE
SagaRebindOnRefusal ==
    /\ sg = "exec"
\* MUTATION: re-bind whether or not the bound copy mirrors.
--- END